'''Love''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading.       

== Appearance ==
It’s blade is deep pink in color with a tiny engraving of a heart near the tip. Below the heart are also a few scratch marks. The guard is red, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Love (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

